<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIAN FIRST DIVISION STATISTICS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIAN FIRST DIVISION STATISTICS.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steaua Bucharest won the</p>
<p>Romanian league title for the 19th time on Saturday.</p>
<p>Romania's title winners and runners-up after the World War</p>
