<p>Since the League began in 1932 the following clubs have won</p>
<p>the title:</p>
<p>19 - Steaua Bucharest</p>
<p>14 - Dinamo Bucharest</p>
<p>6 - UT Arad</p>
<p>4  - Venus Bucharest, Ripensia Timisoara, Universitatea</p>
<p>Craiova</p>
<p>3 - Petrolul Ploiesti</p>
<p>2 - F.C. Arges Pitesti</p>
<p>1 - ICO Oradea, Rapid Bucharest, Unirea Tricolor Bucharest</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>The league system started in Romania in 1932 after national</p>
<p>association has affiliated to FIFA, world gouverning soccer</p>
<p>body. Between 1909 and 1931 different competitional systems were</p>
<p>available but not after the classic league's rules.</p>
<p>The Romanian soccer league was suspended due to World War</p>
<p>Two, between 1941 and 1946.</p>
<p>Romanian soccer championship between 1950 and 1956 played</p>
<p>after the rules of the Soviet Union' soccer, along a one year</p>
<p>competition.</p>
